            "detailed_description": "Colossal, deep space, fleet scale conquest… in miniature!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMoonStrike is a boiled down realtime strategy game, built for both Vive and Oculus Touch controllers (controllers required).  Take over planets as fast as possible, build ships, and take over the galaxy!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you can drag and drop a folder, you can play MoonStrike… I mean, badly… but still!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Three player multiplayer<br />\r\n* Cross platform play<br />\r\n* Five different races with unique advantages<br />\r\n* AI from basic to advanced<br />\r\n* Themed and randomly generated arenas",
